.el .ds Aq '
.TH nws-lookup 1  "nws-lookup " 
.SH NAME
nws\-lookup \- Find the National Weather Service identifiers for a location
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBnws\-lookup\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-stations\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILOCATION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find the National Weather Service identifiers for a location
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-stations\fR \fI<STATIONS>\fR [default: 5]
Number of nearby observation stations to list
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILOCATION\fR>
ICAO station (KSJC), latitude,longitude (37.3592,\-121.9242) or US street address
